{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Castillon is a bite-sized  strategy game that blends RTS and TD gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a renown wizard you lay claim to a new land to build your castle. But beware, for demon invaders roam the wilds. Grow your castle during the day then fight off waves of enemies at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/24c9432c11937992ac11c5680698c8a1.poster.avif?t=1757892800\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/24c9432c11937992ac11c5680698c8a1.webm?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/24c9432c11937992ac11c5680698c8a1.mp4?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the base-building and resource management of classic RTS titles like <i>WarCraft 3</i>, the defensive experimentation of <i>GemCraft</i>, and simplified tactics of games like <i>Thronefall</i> and <i>Bad North</i> \u2013 Castillon aims to offer a familiar yet unique experience that borrows from some of our favorite titles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up resources and spend them to expand your base as you see fit. There are no limits on building placements. Plan carefully to protect your castle and survive increasingly challenging nightly attacks. Each morning, you\u2019ll be able to draft a new means of enhancing your hero or base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness Mystical Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the 4 schools of magic: Holy, Arcane, Necrotic and Engineering to defeat your foes. Experiment with different magical combinations to maximize your defenses with unique and powerful elemental Towers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your Kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day you can help your villagers collect resources, focus on building, or venture out in search of loot and additional magic gems. Build homes, farms, towers, barracks, walls and more to fortify your base. Striking a balance between economy and defense is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/1823bc5ca9b429941eb735c041baa8fe.poster.avif?t=1757892800\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/1823bc5ca9b429941eb735c041baa8fe.webm?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/1823bc5ca9b429941eb735c041baa8fe.mp4?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castillon is super compact experience. The main campaign is likely to take you 4-6 hours. <br>You can always adjust the difficulty with modifiers, all whilst chasing clever achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has all the hallmarks of a tiny classic RTS base defense. It is crafted to provide the same fun but distilled in a bite sized and approachable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy building and defending your kingdom!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483570?t=1757892800","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483570?t=1757892800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/6816439e094f1d251f968c775d062a6da9c0756e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757892800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/6816439e094f1d251f968c775d062a6da9c0756e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757892800","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Castillon is a bite-sized  strategy game that blends RTS and TD gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a renown wizard you lay claim to a new land to build your castle. But beware, for demon invaders roam the wilds. Grow your castle during the day then fight off waves of enemies at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/24c9432c11937992ac11c5680698c8a1.poster.avif?t=1757892800\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/24c9432c11937992ac11c5680698c8a1.webm?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/24c9432c11937992ac11c5680698c8a1.mp4?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the base-building and resource management of classic RTS titles like <i>WarCraft 3</i>, the defensive experimentation of <i>GemCraft</i>, and simplified tactics of games like <i>Thronefall</i> and <i>Bad North</i> \u2013 Castillon aims to offer a familiar yet unique experience that borrows from some of our favorite titles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up resources and spend them to expand your base as you see fit. There are no limits on building placements. Plan carefully to protect your castle and survive increasingly challenging nightly attacks. Each morning, you\u2019ll be able to draft a new means of enhancing your hero or base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness Mystical Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the 4 schools of magic: Holy, Arcane, Necrotic and Engineering to defeat your foes. Experiment with different magical combinations to maximize your defenses with unique and powerful elemental Towers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your Kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day you can help your villagers collect resources, focus on building, or venture out in search of loot and additional magic gems. Build homes, farms, towers, barracks, walls and more to fortify your base. Striking a balance between economy and defense is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/1823bc5ca9b429941eb735c041baa8fe.poster.avif?t=1757892800\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/1823bc5ca9b429941eb735c041baa8fe.webm?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/extras/1823bc5ca9b429941eb735c041baa8fe.mp4?t=1757892800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castillon is super compact experience. The main campaign is likely to take you 4-6 hours. <br>You can always adjust the difficulty with modifiers, all whilst chasing clever achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has all the hallmarks of a tiny classic RTS base defense. It is crafted to provide the same fun but distilled in a bite sized and approachable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy building and defending your kingdom!</p>","developers":["One Up Plus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483570/7b90090c3f0e578ff63d84a855e117ad5f17a8bb/header.jpg?t=1757892800","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2483570/51899094/bd55e20a5d30fb737ebc70a3cf02d8ba55e57fb5/1755720987/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755722842","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2483570/51899094/bd55e20a5d30fb737ebc70a3cf02d8ba55e57fb5/1755720987/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755722842","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2483570/51899094/bd55e20a5d30fb737ebc70a3cf02d8ba55e57fb5/1755720987/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755722842","id":257186277,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186277/movie480.mp4?t=1755722842","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186277/movie_max.mp4?t=1755722842"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186277/24a6ffd488ef85c9b8d05925332893fed0a4c9f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755722842","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186277/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755722842","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186277/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755722842"}}],"name":"Castillon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10