vive each night. Master all four schools of magic to craft the ultimate defenses!","steam_appid":2483570,"support_info":{"email":"support@oneupplustrust.com","url":"https://www.oneupplustrust.com/contactus.html"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.oneupplustrust.com"}